# Keys a freshly initialised node's configuration files carry that no section
# declares. Regenerate with -update.
#
# A migration builds sei.toml from the declared keys, so every line here is a value
# an operator can write today that the migration would read past and drop. Empty is
# the finished state, and it is the condition for shipping the migration.
#
# Read through the same source the migration reads, so this measures what that
# migration would actually see rather than what a struct's tags suggest.

